# Card osLDRRqj (org census 8VXvUrQ5): `google-github-actions/auth` writes
# gha-creds-<hash>.json into the workspace, and every `gcloud run deploy --source .` /
# `gcloud builds submit .` in .github/workflows (deploy.yml, deploy-realapp.yml, preview.yml)
# uploads the workspace root after it.
#
# Once a .gcloudignore exists gcloud uses ONLY its contents, so this file restates the
# lines of gcloud's generated default (.gcloudignore, .git, .gitignore, #!include:.gitignore)
# and adds the credentials file. Dropping .git would ship full history plus actions/checkout's
# persisted token. create_credentials_file: false is NOT an option: later gcloud steps read it.
.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore
#!include:.gitignore
gha-creds-*.json
